Package: scripturesstudio-assets
Version: 0.4
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Reuben Institute <reubeninstitute@gmail.com>
Description: Video/audio/image assets for Reuben Institute's ScripturesStudio
 Background fog videos, Suno music tracks, cover images, and generated
 background videos (Midjourney/Kling) used by ScripturesStudio to
 produce the Psalms and Parashot video series. Editable/growing content,
 meant to be added to in place (e.g. via ScripturesStudio); it is
 overwritten on package upgrade, so additions must be committed back to
 the source repo first.
